# M6 mode 2 (shared save) with four players: two virtual controllers and
# both keyboard halves (P3 left, P4 right). P3 enters 1level, P4 solves
# 0level again, P1 opens the pause, P2 walks.
size 854x480
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
solve
idle 900
key escape
key down 3
key enter
idle
key down 4
key enter
pads 2
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
key space
key enter
expect state join Coop players=4
pad 1 up 5
pad 1 right
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
key e
key enter
wait 50
expect state multi SharedSave players=4 views=4
idle
shot 01-shared-4
p3 walk 1level
p3 press wait
p4 walk 0level
p4 press wait
p3 idle
p4 idle
p3 expect level baba/1level
p4 expect level baba/0level
p2 walk 1level
p1 press pause
shot 02-shared-4-mixed
p1 press back
p3 solve
wait 10
p1 expect icon 1level 3
p2 expect icon 1level 3
p3 idle 900
expect save 0 baba 1level 3
p4 press pause
p4 press down
p4 press wait
p4 idle
p4 expect level baba/106level
shot 03-shared-4-after
p1 press pause
p1 press down 3
p1 press wait
idle
expect state title
quit
